{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the procedure. I need to:\n\n1. Create build scripts for both the farmers markets and census data\n2. Ingest them into the catalog\n3. Create a metric that joins them and calculates farmers markets per 100,000 residents\n4. Query the metric and verify the answer\n\nLet me start by creating the scripts. I'll need to:\n- First ingest the farmers markets data\n- Then ingest the census data\n- Then create a combined metric that calculates the per capita rate\n\nThe users said to use both sources, so I need to handle:\n- https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv - farmers markets by state\n- https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv - census data\n\nLet me start by creating the build directory and scripts.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll ingest both datasets and create a metric for farmers markets per 100,000 residents. Let me start by creating the build scripts."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01SLStLhYTboAPB5iojubCvK","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p .xorq/scripts"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":323,"cacheRead":8642,"cacheWrite":4771,"totalTokens":13749,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.0016150000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0008642000000000001,"cacheWrite":0.00596375,"total":0.00845595},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":228},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915057664,"responseId":"msg_011Ce786oxdyRKbEABmpkabC","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01SLStLhYTboAPB5iojubCvK","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915061803}]}
