{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! The answer has been verified. All three obligations have been discharged:\n1. Total farmers markets: 7,944 ✓\n2. US population 2025: 341,784,857 ✓\n3. Markets per 100k: 2.3243 (verified from 2.324269152743651) ✓\n\nNow let me also verify the lineage of the metric alias to make sure it's backed by the real sources.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01UMeKEVi6dCjSFdoiMjp37C","name":"xorq_check_lineage","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","alias":"farmers_markets_per_capita","no_local":true}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":219,"cacheRead":19840,"cacheWrite":928,"totalTokens":20999,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.001095,"cacheRead":0.001984,"cacheWrite":0.00116,"total":0.004251},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":109},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915127697,"responseId":"msg_011Ce78BzzYaHC55gYmvWbdm","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01UMeKEVi6dCjSFdoiMjp37C","toolName":"xorq_check_lineage","content":[{"type":"text","text":" ✅ VERIFIED   lineage · farmers_markets_per_capita  ·  2 sources\n   ✓ lineage reaches a source from its root\n   ✓ read_csv(https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv)  via pandas\n   ✓ read_csv(https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv)  via pandas"}],"details":{"alias":"farmers_markets_per_capita","sources":[{"node":"@read_3f612b18e608","op":"Read","method":"read_csv","path":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv","table":"farmers_markets","profile":"beee580ceeacddc83bd6914e17f47319_0","con_name":"pandas","snapshot_hash":"3f612b18e608f1c1c2bf62ee0a528e47"},{"node":"@read_2ecedec8ecd4","op":"Read","method":"read_csv","path":"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/huss